  "_comment": "Minesweeper ad catalogue, same format and creatives as Pac-Man's sponsor-media.json. 'continue' plays on Game Over's Watch Ad & Continue (once per level attempt). 'level_gate' plays after Congratulations when the player presses Next Level on every 3rd level (3, 6, 9 ...). 'restart' plays when the player presses Restart in the game bar (Pac-Man: one ad-gated restart per level attempt; no ad shown = no restart). 'recover' plays 5 times in a row when, after a 24-hour reset, the player unlocks a locked level with ads (Level Select, or the in-game Prev / Next / popup level buttons); skippable after 10 seconds, and each finished or skipped ad moves straight on to the next of the 5. 'level_complete_banner' is the MREC 300x250 inside the Congratulations popup. 'banner' is the VERTICAL_BANNER 300x600 shown beside the board during play, 'leaderboard' the LEADER_BOARD 970x90 shown above it. Every image placement rotates every 5 seconds. All creatives are bundled locally in assets/ads/ - swap in your own files (same names) or edit the entries. When index.html is opened from file:// this file cannot be fetched; routines.js then uses its built-in copy of the same catalogue.",
